{"Color vision":"Koloreen ikusmena","Every goal met. The neighborhood noticed.":"Helburu guztiak bete dira. Auzoak ikusi du.","Market Manager — an original neighborhood market game. Plays offline.":"Market Manager — auzoko merkatuaren jokoa. Deskonektatuta dago.","Neighborhood Favorite":"Auzoaren gustukoena.","Harbor Lane":"Harbour Laneko bidea","Gamepad d-pad / left stick":"Gamepad d-pad / ezkerreko stick","Gamepad A":"A joko-plataforma","Gamepad B":"B joko-plataforma","Gamepad Start":"Jarraitu","Gamepad Y":"Jolasa-plataforma Y","Tap / click a shelf":"Sakatu apalategi bat","restock it (or open its actions)":"Berreskuratu (edo bere ekintzak ireki)","Tap / click a checkout":"Sakatu / sakatu ordainketa","serve the next guest":"Hurrengo gonbidatua zerbitzatu.","move focus between market actions":"Merkatu-ekintzen arteko fokua aldatzea","Enter / Space":"Enter / Space","confirm the focused action":"baieztatu ekintza zuzena","hint":"iradokizuna","undo (Practice only)":"Atzera (Praktisa bakarrik)","reset camera":"Kamera berrabiarazi.","pause / close panel":"Geldialdi bat / itxi panel","move focus":"Mugitu fokua.","confirm":"baieztatu","cancel / close":"Bertan behera utzi / itxi","pause":"pausatu","new market in {h}h {m}m":"Merkatu berri bat {h}h {m}m","Mastery stage":"Maisutasun etapa","Platform leaderboard":"Plataformako liderrak","Top shifts":"Goiko txandak","Go":"Joan","Something went wrong repeatedly — the shift was paused":"Zerbait gaizki atera zen behin eta berriz. — Txanda eten egin da.","Guest served +{n}":"Gonbidatuak zerbitzatzen +{n}","A guest left angry":"Gonbidatu bat haserre joan da.","A guest found empty shelves":"Gonbidatu batek apalategi hutsak aurkitu zituen.","Undone":"Desegin","No actions available right now":"Une honetan ez dago ekintzarik erabilgarri","Serve checkout {n} — guests are waiting":"{n} — Gonbidatuak zain daude.","Restock shelf {n}":"{n} hornidura biltegia","You can afford to unlock a department":"Departamentu bat ireki dezakezu.","Hire a cashier from the staff panel":"Kontratatu kutxazain bat.","Hire a stocker from the staff panel":"Hartu galtzerdi bat langileen artean.","Upgrade a checkout":"Ordainketa eguneratu","Upgrade a shelf":"Apalategi bat hobetu.","Tutorial progress reset":"Tutorialaren aurrerapena berrabiarazi.","That shelf is already full":"Apalategia beteta dago.","No one is waiting there":"Inor ez dago zain.","Not enough coins":"Txanpon gutxi.","That department is still locked":"Saila itxita dago oraindik.","Already fully upgraded":"Erabat eguneratuta dago.","Already on the team":"Taldean dago jada.","Already unlocked":"Irekita dago.","Out of moves":"Mugimenduetatik kanpo","This shift has ended":"Txanda amaitu da.","Not allowed in this stage":"Ez dago baimenduta.","No shelf there":"Ez dago apalarik.","No checkout there":"Ez dago kutxazainik.","No such role":"Ez dago horrelako paperik.","Nothing to upgrade there":"Ez dago ezer hobetzeko.","No such department":"Ez dago horrelako departamenturik.","That action did not make sense":"Ez zuen zentzurik.","Unknown action":"Ekintza ezezaguna.","That will not work right now":"Orain ez du funtzionatuko.","Learn":"Ikasi","Four short lessons that teach one rule at a time by doing.":"Lau ikasgai labur, arau bat ikasten dutenak.","2–4 min each":"2–4 minutu bakoitzeko","Practice · not ranked":"Praktikak ez daude sailkatuta.","Journey":"Bidaia","Forty authored stages, from first shift to market legend.":"Berrogei etapa, lehen txandatik merkatuko kondaira izatera.","3–8 min each":"3–8 minutu bakoitzeko","Progress saved locally":"Aurrerapena lokalean gorde da","Daily":"Egunero","One shared market per UTC day. Same seed for everyone.":"UTC eguneko merkatu partekatu bat. Hazi bera denontzat.","~4 min":"- 4 minutu.","Local board · personal best":"Tokiko batzordea · pertsonala onena","Practice":"Praktika","Pick a pace and play freely. Undo is allowed here.":"Aukeratu erritmo bat eta jolastu askatasunez. Atzera egitea baimenduta dago hemen.","3–5 min":"3–5 minutu","Not ranked · undo on":"Ez dago sailkatua.","Challenge":"Erronka","Five constrained stages: move limits, speed, altered floors.":"Bost fase mugatuak: mugimendu mugak, abiadura, solairu aldatuak.","2–6 min each":"2–6 minutu bakoitzeko","Score chase":"Puntuazio-jazarpena","Play any beaten stage for a higher score on the board.":"Edozein fase jokatu taula gainean puntuazio handiagoa lortzeko.","3–8 min":"3–8 min","Restock shelves":"Biltegiak","Guests buy from stocked shelves. Tap a shelf (or its button) to refill it from the stockroom. Refilling costs coins per item.":"Gonbidatuek apalategietan erosten dute. Ukitu apalategi bat (edo bere botoia) biltegitik berriz betetzeko. Berriz betetzeak txanponak balio du.","Serve the queue":"Zerbitzatu ilara.","Guests with goods line up at a checkout. Tap the counter to serve the next guest before their patience runs out.":"Bezeroak kaxa batean ilara egiten dute. Jo mahai gainean hurrengo gonbidatua zerbitzatzeko pazientzia amaitu aurretik.","Unlock departments":"Ireki sailak.","Greyed-out shelves belong to locked departments. Pay the unlock cost to open them and raise your goal progress.":"Apalategi grisak giltzapetuta daudenenak dira. Ordaindu desblokeatzeko kostua irekitzeko eta igo zure helburua aurrerapena.","Upgrade stations":"Geltoki berritzaileak","Upgraded shelves hold more and sell for more. Upgraded checkouts keep queued guests patient longer.":"Apalategi hobetuek gehiago gordetzen dute eta gehiago saltzen dute. Kutxa berriek pazientzia handiagoa dute.","Hire staff":"Langileak kontratatu","A stocker refills the emptiest shelf every few ticks; a cashier serves the longest queue. Staff act on their own.":"Kutxazainak apalategi hutsena betetzen du, eta kutxazainak ilara luzeena betetzen du. Langileek beren kabuz jokatzen dute.","Win the shift":"Txanda irabazi.","Meet every goal — guests served, coins earned, departments unlocked — before the shift timer ends. Fewer angry guests means a better score.":"Helburu guztiak bete. — Gonbidatuak zerbitzatu, txanponak irabazi, departamentuak ireki. — Txanda amaitu baino lehen. Gonbidatu haserre gutxiago, emaitza hobea.","Practice — {pace}":"Praktikatu — {pace}","Daily Market — {date}":"Eguneroko merkatua — {date}","Serve {n} guests":"Zerbitzatu {n} gonbidatuei.","serve {cur}/{max}":"Zerbitzatu {cur}/{max}","earn {cur}/{max}":"irabazi {cur}/{max}","unlock {cur}/{max}":"{cur}/{max} desblokeatu.","angry {cur}/{max} max":"haserre {cur}/{max} gehienez","Goals — {list}":"Helburuak — {list}","Free play":"Jolas librea","Journey: {won} of 40 stages complete · {guests} guests served all time":"Bidaia: {won} 40 etapa osatu · {guests} gonbidatuak zerbitzatu denbora guztian","New around here? Start with Learn, or jump straight into Journey.":"Berria zara? Hasi Ikasi, edo zuzenean joan Bidaiara.","Progress synced · posts to the platform leaderboard":"Aurrerapenak sinkronizatuta daude.","Personal best · posts to the platform leaderboard":"Pertsonalki egin ditudan post onenak.","About {duration}":"Zer gertatzen da? {duration}","Lessons":"Ikasgaiak","Journey stages":"Bidaiaren etapak","Daily market":"Eguneroko merkatua","Practice pace":"Praktikatzeko erritmoa","Challenges":"Erronkak","Score chase — pick a stage":"Puntuazioaren jazarpena — etapa bat aukeratu","Stages":"Etapak","Par {time} · best {best}":"Par {time} · onena {best}","Par {time}":"Par {time}","Finish earlier stages to unlock this one":"Amaitu aurreko faseak hau desblokeatzeko.","Locked":"Blokeatuta","Cleared":"Argi dago.","serve {n}":"{n} zerbitzatu.","earn {n}":"irabazi {n}","unlock {n}":"{n} desblokeatu","Goals: {list}":"Helburuak: {list}","Open play":"Joko irekia.","Up to {time}":"{time} arte","Casual — progress syncs to your account":"— aurrerapena sinkronizatzen da zure kontuarekin.","Ranked — your total posts to the platform leaderboard":"— sailkatu zure mezuak plataforma liderra taulara","Casual — result stays on this device":"Kasualitatezko — emaitza gailu honetan geratzen da","Player":