ostua {cost}","{n} invalid action":"{n} ekintza baliogabea","{n} invalid actions":"{n} Ekintza baliogabeak","Stock the shelves. Serve the rush. Grow the corner market.":"Hornigaiak apaletan. Zerbitzatu larrialdia. Azoka handiagoa.","Daily market:":"Eguneroko merkatua:","Play":"Jolasa","All modes":"Modu guztiak.","How to play":"Nola jokatu","Settings":"Ezarpenak","Choose a mode":"Aukeratu modu bat","Back":"Itzuli","Expected length":"Luzera aurreikustua","Rules":"Arauak","Standing":"Zutik","Start shift":"Hasi txanda.","Coins":"Txanponak","Time":"Denbora","Guests":"Gonbidatuak.","Score":"Puntuazioa","Undo last action":"Azken ekintza bertan behera utzi.","Show a hint":"Erakutsi zerbait.","Toggle staff panel":"Langileak aldatzea.","Pause game":"Pausatu jokoa","Paused":"Pausatuta","Resume":"Curriculuma","End shift":"Azken aldaketa.","Total":"Guztira","Retry":"Saiatu berriro","Mode select":"Modu hautatzea","Display":"Pantaila","Theme":"Gaia","Stage default":"Fasearen ezarpenak","Camera":"Kamera","Isometric":"Isometrikoak","High":"Altua","Low":"Baxua","Standard":"Estandarra","Deuteranopia-safe":"Deuteranopia segurua","Protanopia-safe":"Protanopia segurua","Tritanopia-safe":"Tritanopia segurua","Accessibility and controls":"irisgarritasuna eta kontrolak","Left-handed layout":"Ezkerraldeko diseinua","Haptics":"Haptikak","Replay tutorials":"Erreproduzitu tutorialak","First Shift":"Lehenengo Shift","Morning Rush":"Goizaldeko Izpi","Full Shelves":"Apalategi beteak.","Mastery: Bakery":"Okindegia.","Green Expansion":"Zabalkuntza berdea","Two Aisles":"Bi pasabide.","Split Attention":"Arreta banatu","Mastery: Two Aisles":"Maitasuna: bi pasabide.","Bigger Baskets":"Saski handiagoak","Premium Shelves":"Premium apalategiak","Quick Counters":"Kontagailu azkarrak","Mastery: Upgrades":"Maitasuna: hobekuntzak.","First Hire":"Lehen kontratazioa.","Delegation":"Ordezkaritza","Hands Off":"Kendu eskuak.","Mastery: Staffing":"Maitasuna: langileak.","Cold Goods":"Produktu hotzak","Chilled Rush":"Hotza","Three-Way Split":"Hiru norabideko banaketa","Mastery: Trio":"Maitasuna:","Flower Corner":"Loreen txokoa.","Bouquet Boom":"Lore sorta bat","Petal Pressure":"Lore-hostoen presioa","Mastery: Florist":"Lore-saltzailea.","Carvery Opening":"Carveryren irekiera","Prime Cuts":"Lehen mailako murrizketak","Full House":"Osoa","Mastery: Grand Market":"Maisu: Merkatu Handia","Divided Aisles":"Igarobide banatuak","Split Queues":"Ilara zatituak","Long Shift":"Shift luzea","Mastery: Endurance":"Maitasuna: Iraupena","Lean Ledger":"\"Lean Ledger\" izena du","Penny Pinch":"Penny Pinch, ez kezkatu.","Thin Margins":"Marjinatxo finak","Mastery: Economy":"Maitasuna: ekonomia.","Festival Eve":"Festa bezperan","Festival Day":"Jaietako eguna","Grand Gala":"Gala handi bat.","Mastery: Market Legend":"Maitasuna: Merkatuaren kondaira","Lesson 1: Stock the Shelves":"1 ikastaroa: apalategiak hornitu","Guests want fresh rolls. Tap a glowing shelf to restock it from the stockroom.":"Gonbidatuek ogitarteko freskoak nahi dituzte. Ukitu apalategi distiratsu bat biltegitik biltzeko.","A guest is heading to the checkout. Tap the checkout counter to serve them.":"Gonbidatu bat doa kutxara. Jo kutxazainaren mahaian zerbitzatzeko.","Great! Keep shelves stocked and queues short. Serve 3 guests to finish the lesson.":"Zoragarria! Gorde apalategiak beteta eta ilarak motzak. Zerbitzatu 3 gonbidatuei lezioa bukatzeko.","Lesson 2: Grow the Market":"2 ikasgaia: Merkatua handitu","You can afford a new department! Tap the greyed-out Green Basket shelves to unlock them.":"Sail berri bat ordain dezakezu! Ukitu saski berde griseko apalategiak irekitzeko.","New shelves need stock. Restock them, then serve guests from both departments.":"Apalategi berriak behar ditut. Berriz hornitu, eta gero zerbitzatu bi departamentuetako gonbidatuei.","Serve 5 guests total to finish the lesson.":"5 gonbidatu zerbitzatu behar ditugu, ikasgaia amaitzeko.","Lesson 3: Hire Help":"3. ikasgaia: kontratatu laguntza","The market is getting busy. Open the Staff panel and hire a stocker — they restock shelves for you.":"Merkatua lanpetuta dago. Zabaldu langileak eta kontratatu — apalategiak betetzeko.","Now hire a cashier to serve queues automatically.":"Orain, kontratatu kutxazain bat ilarak zerbitzatzeko.","With a full team, the market nearly runs itself. Serve 10 guests to finish.":"Talde osoarekin, merkatua ia berez doa. 10 gonbidatu zerbitzatu.","Lesson 4: Upgrade Everything":"4. ikasgaia: Gauzak hobetu","Upgraded shelves hold more and sell for more. Select a shelf and choose Upgrade.":"Apalategi hobetuek gehiago gordetzen dute eta gehiago saltzen dute. Aukeratu apalategi bat eta aukeratu eguneratzea.","Upgraded checkouts keep queued guests patient longer. Upgrade a checkout.":"Kutxa berriek pazientzia handiagoa dute. Igogailu bat.","Now put it all together: serve 12 guests and earn 80 coins.":"Orain dena batu: 12 gonbidatu zerbitzatu eta 80 txanpon irabazi.","Ten Moves Only":"Hamar mugimendu bakarrik.","Every action counts — only 10 moves. Hire staff and let them work.":"Ekintza bakoitzak balio du. — Bakarrik 10 Mugimenduak. Langileak kontratatu eta lan egiten utzi.","Speed Shift":"Abiadura Shift","A very short shift with a big queue. Move fast.":"Oso txanda laburra ilara handi batekin. Azkar.","Empty Shelves":"Apalategi hutsak","The delivery never came. Every shelf starts empty.":"Ez zen inoiz iritsi. Apalategi guztiak hutsik hasten dira.","One Counter":"Kontagailu bat.","One checkout, endless guests. Keep the line moving.":"Kutxa bat, bezero amaigabeak. Segi lerroa mugitzen.","No Help Wanted":"Ez zuten laguntzarik nahi.","Staff is on holiday. Run the whole floor yourself.":"Langileak oporretan daude. Zoaz solairu guztian zehar.","Rise & Crumb Bakery":"Rise & Crumb Okindegia","Green Basket":"Saski berdea","Cold Corner":"Hotz txokoa","Petal & Stem":"Petaloak eta enborra","Carvery Counter":"Carvery Kontagailua","Sunrise Row":"Egunsentiaren lerroa.","Meadow Fair":"Belardiko Azoka","Dusk Market":"Ilunabarreko Merkatua","Frost Square":"Izozte plaza","Complete your first stage.":"Bukatu lehen fasea.","Open all five departments in one market.":"Ireki bost departamentuak merkatu berean.","Hot Streak":"Marra beroa","Win three stages in a row.":"Hiru etapa segidan irabazi.","Market Legend":"Merkatuaren kondaira","Complete the final journey stage.":"Bidaia amaitzeko.","Serve 500 guests in total.":"500 gonbidatu zerbitzatu.","Relaxed":"Lasai","Intense":"Bizia","Sound, graphics, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"Soinua, grafikoak, hizkuntza, testu handiagoa, kontraste handia eta mugimendu murriztua StarHermit Aukeretan daude.","Open Options":"Ireki Aukerak","Key bindings":"Tekla-loturak"}
